<section class="vx-sec"><h3>C &mdash; Dot plot per measure</h3><p class="vx-note">One axis per measure with the three buildings placed on it. The only variant where the SIZE of a difference is visible rather than stated &mdash; two buildings sitting on top of each other says &ldquo;level&rdquo; without needing a label.</p><div class="vc">
