<section class="vx-sec"><h3>D &mdash; Cards with position bullets</h3><p class="vx-note">One card per building; inside it every measure shows where that building sits within the trio. Stacks natively on a phone and reads building-first, which is how people actually shortlist.</p><div class="vd">
